          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Waan isani worra sunini jettani: Waaqa keesani ka lafafi gubba inuumini kana imballeesani. Deebiani lafa keesa fulla tokoleti inargani.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
