          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi lafa tana keesaa isani balleesu fed'a; inni isani ch'ach'arase hafto isani d'owa. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.18",
